  title={Communicating meaning and team role through gesturing telepresence robots},
  author={Sirkin, David and Ju, Wendy},
  abstract={We ran two studies to explore how gesturing tele-presence robots can support better communication in distributed teams. Crowdsourced participants provided their impressions of: (1) the meaning of individual gestures, and (2) the social roles of team partners. Collaborators were better understood when their robotic intermediaries portrayed gestures in concert with their facial expressions.},
